abstract: >-
  GenCoord is a decentralized protocol for embodied LLM agents that hold
  private task information. Each proposal pairs the sender's skill path with
  its partner's continuation; compatible proposals become conditional
  commitments that are executed and checked in Minecraft, so models spend
  inference on choosing and revising the division of work rather than on
  dialogue.
keywords:
  - multi-agent systems
  - LLM agents
  - embodied coordination
  - commitments
  - Minecraft
